            <!-- OVERVIEW -->
            <div class="detail-section" id="overview">
                <span class="sec-tag">Project Overview</span>
                <h2 class="sec-title mb-3">Overview <span>Alliance Bhaskar Malad West</span></h2>
                <p style="text-align: justify;"><strong>Alliance Bhaskar</strong> is a premier residential apartment project situated in the sought-after locality of Malad West, one of Mumbai's most developed western suburbs. Developed by the renowned <strong>Alliance City Developers</strong>, this exclusive project offers a boutique living experience with 14 meticulously designed apartments. Featuring spacious 2 and 3 BHK configurations ranging from 520 to 789 square feet, Alliance Bhaskar is crafted for discerning homebuyers seeking luxury, comfort, and convenience in a prime Mumbai location. The project's strategic positioning near Liberty Garden in Malad West ensures seamless connectivity to major business hubs, entertainment zones, and social infrastructure, making it an ideal choice for families and professionals alike.</p>
<p style="text-align: justify;">The architectural design of Alliance Bhaskar combines modern aesthetics with functional living spaces, maximizing natural light and ventilation in every apartment. Each residence is thoughtfully planned to offer a harmonious blend of style and practicality, making it an ideal choice for those seeking a ready-to-move home in Mumbai. Located close to the Malad railway station, Western Express Highway, and the upcoming Mith Chowky Metro Station, the project offers a serene living environment while keeping you connected to the city's vibrant energy. With Alliance City Developers' legacy of trust and quality, <span style="text-decoration: underline;"><strong><a href="https://upcomingprop.com/alliance/mumbai/alliance-bhaskar-malad-west/" target="_blank">Alliance Bhaskar</a></strong></span> is a landmark address in Mumbai's real estate landscape.</p>
<p style="text-align: justify;">Malad West is renowned for its excellent social infrastructure, including top-rated schools like Atharva Institute of Management Studies and Orchid International School, world-class hospitals such as Thunga Hospital and CritiCare Asia, and easy access to shopping destinations like Infiniti Mall. The neighborhood's vibrant lifestyle, coupled with its proximity to the Mumbai International Airport and major commercial districts, makes it a preferred choice for those who value both luxury and convenience. Whether you are looking for a dream home or a high-growth investment, Alliance Bhaskar offers exceptional value and long-term appreciation in one of Mumbai's most prestigious locations.</p>
<div class="row g-3 mt-3">
                    <div class="col-6 col-md-3"><div class="about-stat"><strong>Alliance City Developers</strong><span>Developer</span></div></div>
                    <div class="col-6 col-md-3"><div class="about-stat"><strong>On Request*</strong><span>Starting Price</span></div></div>
                    <div class="col-6 col-md-3"><div class="about-stat"><strong>1 Building</strong><span>Total Units</span></div></div>
