<div class="row g-3">
    <div class="col-md-6">
        <div class="about-dev-section" style="background:var(--bg-light);border-radius:var(--radius);padding:20px">
            <h5 style="font-size:0.92rem;font-weight:700;color:var(--dark);margin-bottom:10px">
                <i class="fa fa-chart-bar me-2" style="color:var(--accent)"></i>Why Invest Here?
            </h5>
            <p style="font-size:0.82rem;color:var(--text-light);line-height:1.7;margin:0">
                Malad West is one of Mumbai's most premium residential addresses, offering excellent connectivity, top-tier social infrastructure, and a prestigious lifestyle. With the upcoming Mith Chowky Metro Station, the Versova Bandra Sea Link, and the area's continuous development, investing in Alliance Bhaskar offers significant long-term value and appreciation potential.
            </p>
        </div>
    </div>

    <div class="col-md-6">
        <div class="about-dev-section" style="background:var(--bg-light);border-radius:var(--radius);padding:20px">
            <h5 style="font-size:0.92rem;font-weight:700;color:var(--dark);margin-bottom:10px">
                <i class="fa fa-road me-2" style="color:var(--accent)"></i>Growth Drivers
            </h5>
            <p style="font-size:0.82rem;color:var(--text-light);line-height:1.7;margin:0">
                Proximity to Mumbai Airport, the upcoming metro line, Mindspace IT Park, and the area's reputation as a commercial and residential hub make Malad West a prime investment destination. The limited inventory of premium apartments and the brand legacy of Alliance City Developers further enhance the project's attractiveness.
            </p>
        </div>
