                <h2 class="sec-title mb-3">About <span>Alliance City Developers</span></h2>
                <div class="row g-4 align-items-center">
                    <div class="col-md-8">
                        <p style="text-align: justify;"><strong>Alliance City Developers</strong> is a premier real estate company in Mumbai with a strong focus on delivering projects that meet the highest standards of quality. With a portfolio of 16 successful projects, the company has consistently made great strides in fulfilling the dreams of a large number of esteemed customers. Alliance City Developers is armed with a team of talented professionals who are highly knowledgeable and proficient in the real estate sector, always ready to deliver more than what has been asked for.</p>
<p style="text-align: justify;">Alliance City Developers' philosophy revolves around creating sustainable communities that enhance the quality of life. Their projects are meticulously planned, incorporating the latest trends in architecture and design. <span style="text-decoration: underline;"><strong><a href="https://upcomingprop.com/alliance-developers/" target="_blank">Alliance Upcoming Projects</a></strong></span> exemplifies their vision of offering premium residential apartments in strategic locations. With a customer-centric approach and a track record of delivering successful projects, Alliance City Developers continues to be a preferred choice for discerning buyers in Mumbai.</p>
                    </div>
                    <div class="col-md-4">
                        <div class="row g-2">
                            <div class="col-6"><div class="about-stat"><strong>16+</strong><span>Projects Delivered</span></div></div>
                            <div class="col-6"><div class="about-stat"><strong>Trusted</strong><span>Developer Brand</span></div></div>
                            <div class="col-6"><div class="about-stat"><strong>Premium</strong><span>Mumbai Locations</span></div></div>
                            <div class="col-6"><div class="about-stat"><strong>Customer</strong><span>Centric Approach</span></div></div>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
                <a href="/alliance-developers/" class="btn-outline mt-4"><i class="fa fa-building me-2"></i>View All Alliance Projects</a>
            </div>

            <!-- TESTIMONIALS -->
            <div class="detail-section">
                <span class="sec-tag">Reviews</span>
                <h2 class="sec-title mb-4">Customer <span>Testimonials</span></h2>
                <div class="swiper testiSwiper">
